Package: imuMAP
Title: Immunity: Mapping, Aggregation, and Projection
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Carl", "Pearson", email = "carl.ab.pearson@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0701-7860")),
      person("Claire Perrin", "Smith", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1069-9460")),
      person("Weston", "Voglesonger", email = "westonvogle@gmail.com", role = "ctb"))
Description: Tools for geospatial mapping, spatial aggregation, and
    re-projecting vaccination coverage estimates onto new spatial
    organizations and scales (e.g., translating coverage from fine-scale
    units to administrative regions and alternative geographic boundaries).
    Complements 'imuGAP' outputs with spatial alignment, re-scaling, and
    cartographic visualizations.
